{"id":"beeff998335147f4","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-thm-levy-characterization.md","title":"Lévy Characterization of Brownian Motion","display":"thm-levy-characterization — Lévy Characterization of Brownian Motion","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-levy-characterization","aliases":["58-thm-levy-characterization"],"display":"thm-levy-characterization — Lévy Characterization of Brownian Motion","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-semimartingale.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-levy-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-levy-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-levy-characterization — Lévy Characterization of Brownian Motion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"948f8f3178040b74\" href=\"?note=948f8f3178040b74\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md\">../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f0355544d1bb59cc\" href=\"?note=f0355544d1bb59cc\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-semimartingale.md\">../batch01/58-df-semimartingale.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,q,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T\\in V\">\\(M,q,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S,\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S,\\mathrm{LocalMartingale}_S,\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S,\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S,\\mathrm{LocalMartingale}_S,\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are the predicates from the dependencies.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContEvent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ContEvent}_S\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QVErrorEvent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{QVErrorEvent}_S\\)</span> 是下式给出的事件集合函数，定义域要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(M,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(M,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(q,T,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(q,T,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^\\Omega)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T\">\\(t\\in T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon&gt;0\">\\(\\varepsilon&gt;0\\)</span>；各谓词中的使用均在这些类型条件下。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContEvent}_S(M,\\Omega,T)=\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in T\\;(|s-t|&lt;\\delta\\to|M_s(\\omega)-M_t(\\omega)|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ContEvent}_S(M,\\Omega,T)=\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in T\\;(|s-t|&lt;\\delta\\to|M_s(\\omega)-M_t(\\omega)|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QVErrorEvent}_S(q,M,\\Omega,n,t,\\varepsilon)=\\left\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\n\\left|q_t(\\omega)-\\sum_{k&lt;2^n}\n\\left(M_{\\frac{(k+1)t}{2^n}}(\\omega)-M_{\\frac{kt}{2^n}}(\\omega)\\right)^2\\right|&gt;\\varepsilon\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QVErrorEvent}_S(q,M,\\Omega,n,t,\\varepsilon)=\\left\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\n\\left|q_t(\\omega)-\\sum_{k&lt;2^n}\n\\left(M_{\\frac{(k+1)t}{2^n}}(\\omega)-M_{\\frac{kt}{2^n}}(\\omega)\\right)^2\\right|&gt;\\varepsilon\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land \\mathrm{ContEvent}_S(M,\\Omega,T)\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P(\\mathrm{ContEvent}_S(M,\\Omega,T))=1,\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land \\mathrm{ContEvent}_S(M,\\Omega,T)\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P(\\mathrm{ContEvent}_S(M,\\Omega,T))=1,\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S(q,M,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(M,T,\\mathbb R^{\\Omega})\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,T,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{\\Omega})\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(q_t;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\varepsilon,\\eta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\Bigl(N\\leq n\\to \\mathrm{QVErrorEvent}_S(q,M,\\Omega,n,t,\\varepsilon)\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mathbb P(\\mathrm{QVErrorEvent}_S(q,M,\\Omega,n,t,\\varepsilon))&lt;\\eta\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S(q,M,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(M,T,\\mathbb R^{\\Omega})\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,T,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{\\Omega})\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(q_t;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\varepsilon,\\eta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\Bigl(N\\leq n\\to \\mathrm{QVErrorEvent}_S(q,M,\\Omega,n,t,\\varepsilon)\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mathbb P(\\mathrm{QVErrorEvent}_S(q,M,\\Omega,n,t,\\varepsilon))&lt;\\eta\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S\n(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S(q,M,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\n\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:M(0)(\\omega)\\neq0\\})=0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:q(t)(\\omega)=t\\})=1\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\n\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\n(M,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S\n(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S(q,M,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\n\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:M(0)(\\omega)\\neq0\\})=0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:q(t)(\\omega)=t\\})=1\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\n\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\n(M,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Continuity is an almost-sure path condition, and quadratic variation is convergence in probability of the dyadic squared-increment sums on the same filtered probability space.</li>\n<li>The Brownian-motion conclusion uses the upstream argument order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\">\\((M,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md","status":"resolved","id":"948f8f3178040b74","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-semimartingale.md","status":"resolved","id":"f0355544d1bb59cc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-semimartingale.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,q,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S,\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S,\\mathrm{LocalMartingale}_S,\\mathrm{Measurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContEvent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QVErrorEvent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(M,T,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(q,T,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContEvent}_S(M,\\Omega,T)=\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in T\\;(|s-t|<\\delta\\to|M_s(\\omega)-M_t(\\omega)|<\\varepsilon)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QVErrorEvent}_S(q,M,\\Omega,n,t,\\varepsilon)=\\left\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:\n\\left|q_t(\\omega)-\\sum_{k<2^n}\n\\left(M_{\\frac{(k+1)t}{2^n}}(\\omega)-M_{\\frac{kt}{2^n}}(\\omega)\\right)^2\\right|>\\varepsilon\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{LocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&{}\\land \\mathrm{ContEvent}_S(M,\\Omega,T)\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P(\\mathrm{ContEvent}_S(M,\\Omega,T))=1,\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S(q,M,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(M,T,\\mathbb R^{\\Omega})\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,T,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{\\Omega})\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(q_t;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\varepsilon,\\eta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\Bigl(N\\leq n\\to \\mathrm{QVErrorEvent}_S(q,M,\\Omega,n,t,\\varepsilon)\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mathbb P(\\mathrm{QVErrorEvent}_S(q,M,\\Omega,n,t,\\varepsilon))<\\eta\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S\n(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S(q,M,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\n\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:M(0)(\\omega)\\neq0\\})=0\\\\\n&{}\\land\n\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:q(t)(\\omega)=t\\})=1\\\\\n&{}\\to\n\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\n(M,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"(M,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)","display":false}],"bytes":3605,"backlinks":[{"id":"f621b1eefe16c90e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ContinuousLocalMartingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)$ and $\\mathrm{ContinuousQuadraticVariation}_S(q,M,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,T)$ are the exact filtered-process predicates defined in [[../batch04/58-thm-levy-characterization.md]]."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4281","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-thm-levy-characterization.md|58-thm-levy-characterization]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["948f8f3178040b74","d4d304b0bbb11c1a","f0355544d1bb59cc","bbbec05fde1d3b01","36d7463d215be751"]}